'''Hexen''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in [[Mörkhalla]] and during [[Jotun Invasion]]s. They fly around and cast damaging spells.

Killing a Hexen the first time enables Hexen and [[Krigen]] daytime patrols in the [[Deep North]].

