== Attacks and abilities ==
* '''Magicblast''': 120 [[Damage types#Lightning|Lightning]], 30 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] and 30 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] damage. This attack can be used every three seconds when within 5–20 meters of a target.
* '''Lightningbolt''': a projectile dealing 110 Lightning, 15 [[Damage types#Spirit|Spirit]] and 20 Chop damage in a 3-meter radius where it hits. This attack can be used every three seconds when within 20 meters of a target.
* '''Dodge''': an area attack dealing 150 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]], 200 Chop and 100 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage. There are four dodge variants (left, right, up and down) with the same damage, each usable every six seconds.

